[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14940.55, "timestamp": "04:09:00", "text": "我没死，不然我还能玩呢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14944.229, "timestamp": "04:09:04", "text": "现在。嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14946.87, "timestamp": "04:09:06", "text": "之后，嗯，可能……你知道的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14949.59, "timestamp": "04:09:09", "text": "就像最著名的呃高图形"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14963.269, "timestamp": "04:09:23", "text": "是的。我的天哪，已经12点了。我们已经"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14966.389, "timestamp": "04:09:26", "text": "已经聊了两个小时了，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14968.309, "timestamp": "04:09:28", "text": "哦，等等。我翘了课。哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14973.429, "timestamp": "04:09:33", "text": "等等，你还要上课吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14975.189, "timestamp": "04:09:35", "text": "不，是决斗的那场。还好，幸好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14979.03, "timestamp": "04:09:39", "text": "我可能免费冷冻了一次。好的，等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14980.95, "timestamp": "04:09:40", "text": "做你的双语练习。没关系。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14984.55, "timestamp": "04:09:44", "text": "那挺好的。呃，所以基本上是12点之后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14987.51, "timestamp": "04:09:47", "text": "总之，它已经没了。不，我让你错过了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14989.91, "timestamp": "04:09:49", "text": "你的连胜纪录。不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14991.91, "timestamp": "04:09:51", "text": "不，不。我拿到了免费的东西。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14993.99, "timestamp": "04:09:53", "text": "基本上，呃，我的连胜纪录没能延续下去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14995.63, "timestamp": "04:09:55", "text": "休息，但更多"}]